Retrieve the list of domains you own.

USAGE:
  scw domain domain list [arg=value ...]

ARGS:
  [order-by]          Sort order of the returned domains. (domain_asc | domain_desc)
  [registrar]         Filter domains by registrar.
  [status]            Filter domains by status. (status_unknown | active | creating | create_error | renewing | renew_error | xfering | xfer_error | expired | expiring | updating | checking | locked | deleting)
  [project-id]        Filter domains by project ID.
  [is-external]       Filter domains by whether they are external (not managed by Scaleway as registrar).
  [domain]            Filter domains by domain name.
  [organization-id]   Filter domains by organization ID.

FLAGS:
  -h, --help[=true|false]                help for list
      --list-sub-commands[=true|false]   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta[=true|false]         Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string             The path to the config file
  -D, --debug[=true|false]        Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers[=true|false]   Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string             Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string            The config profile to use
